            "review_title": "Review at Bay Ho Baguette",
            "review_text": "Thang Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam263 contributions\n0\nGood street food\nAug 2023 • Business\nSmall grocery store, located near the city center. This place mainly sells bread, which is served with roasted pork. Bread shaped like French bread, inside will be sandwiched with pork, cucumber, chili and spices. The area of the store is very small, so customers who come to buy have to stand in the street to order. The staff will deliver the goods and collect the money at the waiting location. Good quality roast pork, delicious. Bread costs about 20,000vnd\nRead more\nWritten August 18, 2023",
