            "review_title": "Review at Bay Ho Baguette",
            "review_text": "Matt7722\nThe Hague, The Netherlands64 contributions\n1\nOne of the best Bánh Mì - hard to find but worth it.\nJan 2016 • Friends\nTucked away down a small little alley is a stand that has been there for 80 years. My guide took me to this place which is one of her lesser know places. \nThey open at 2pm - 5pm and sell 600 Bánh Mì then close up for the day. \nI sat on a stool in the street ate my first, then second and tool a third home for later, in the time it took me to eat two they must have sold 30 or 40 more. \n15,000 Dong / $0.80 UDS\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 28, 2016",
